  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Guan Xi, Gu tribe alliance leader Gu Guo Long orders three defense lines abandoned after a first-battle defeat and pulls the army back to the main camp, then piles stones into a growing mountain with traps at the foot so Hei Lou Lan’s force stalls and even thinks of retreat. Hei Lou Lan calls him as obstinate as the rumors said.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_tribe",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is muscular and stable. He wears a yellow robe.",
      "chapters": [
        583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After repeated losses he secretly writes Liu Wen Wu to side with Liu tribe, and Liu Wen Wu agrees to reinforce if he can hold seven more days.",
      "chapters": [
        524
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "submission-to-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_wen_wu",
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Tai Bai Yun Sheng uses mountain as before and the piled mountain returns to flat grassland, Gu Guo Long greets him as benefactor, then lowers his head under persuasion though he still admires Liu Wen Wu; Gu tribe pledges to Hei Lou Lan. He created that mountain on grassland that mountain as before restores to its original form.",
      "chapters": [
        524
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "submission-to-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the merge, Hei tribe army has three rank five Gu Masters: Hei Lou Lan, Tai Bai Yun Sheng, and the recently subdued Gu Guo Long, named a rank five earth path Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        525
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-five-under-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later takes the stage against Cheng tribe leader Cheng Long with stable attack and defense, the first rank five expert shown from Hei tribe’s side in that Ma tribe contest.",
      "chapters": [
        539
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-five-under-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
